OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian dies weeks after being
OL,4,Ahit by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pedestrian who was seriously injured
OL,7,Fwhen they were hit by a car has died.
OL,9,FA man and a woman were struck by a red
OL,10,FPeugeot 3008 shortly after 15:30 BST on
OL,11,F18 August in Loughborough Road, Quorn.
OL,13,FLeicestershire Police said both were
OL,14,Ftaken to hospital for treatment, but
OL,15,Fthe man died from his injuries on
OL,16,FThursday. The woman remains in
OL,17,Fhospital.
OL,19,FA 67-year-old man was arrested on
OL,20,Fsuspicion of causing serious injury by
OL,21,Fdangerous driving and was released
OL,22,Funder investigation.
